# Personal Website — Christos Zacharopoulos, Ph.D.

## Who this is for

This website belongs to **Christos Zacharopoulos, Ph.D.** — a clinical AI research leader based in Greater Paris. He is actively looking for Director / Head / VP-track roles in healthtech, medtech, and medical-device AI. Relocation is not possible; he is open to fully remote positions, including with US-funded companies.

---

## Strategic purpose

This is a **professional identity page**, not a job-seeking signal. It leads with who Christos is and what he has built. A hiring manager who finds it should feel they discovered someone serious — not someone broadcasting availability.

Three jobs:

1. **Trust page** — online signals can override strong credentials. A structured, credible site reduces recruiter uncertainty before any contact is made. 57% of employers are less likely to call candidates they cannot find online.
2. **Narrative compression** — converts a cross-disciplinary career (neuroimaging, PAD, lung oncology, NLP, biosignals) into a coherent story: *rigorous ML applied repeatedly to hard clinical problems across domains.*
3. **Inbound surface** — makes Christos findable by recruiters searching "clinical AI", "biosignals", "regulated ML", "SaMD validation", "medical device AI".

**Tone constraint**: no "open to work" signals, no availability language, no timezone/overlap framing, no contractor flexibility notes. Identity first.

**This is not an academic portfolio.** One page, simple, fast.

