## Tone and style

- Senior, precise, direct — not academic, not self-promotional
- No buzzwords: avoid "passionate", "innovative", "cutting-edge", "robust", "transformative"
- Statements should be verifiable — every claim backed by a publication, a company name, or a role title
- English only; British or American English consistently (not mixed)

