## Design principles

- Fast to load, minimal dependencies
- Mobile-friendly
- Clean typography — the content carries the credibility, not the design
- No animations that distract from reading
- Accessible (WCAG AA minimum)
- Dark/light mode support is a nice-to-have, not required

